INSERT INTO game_translations (game_id, language_code, title, description) SELECT id, 'en', 'Jade Cocoon 2', 'Presenting a combination of monster breeding and RPG elements, Jade Cocoon 2 expands upon Genki''s original title in a number of significant ways. Gameplay comprises a familiar mix of storytelling and monster raising, with significant tweaks implemented for good measure. The town acts as your base of operations and it''s here you can stock up on supplies, or take jobs for which you can earn money and build a reputation. The latter proves vital as it''s directly related to the number of monsters you can use in battle. The successful completion of certain tests rewards you with the ability to command more beasts -- up to a maximum of 12 at once, however, you can only take these tests when your reputation is high enough.
